      "statusChangeNewStatus": "needs more information",
      "value": "Thanks for the report! Is this a new issue, or were you experiencing this before the Input 2.0 update, too?\n\nIn the past, Vive wands used the trigger both for grabbing and using. The new default bindings replicate the old behavior. (Users edit the defaults bindings, though!)\n\nThere's one minor difference though: The default binds use different thresholds for grab and use. A light trigger pull grabs, and a full trigger pull uses.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
    {
