  "details": "Unlike other major VR controllers, vive wands appear to fire InputGrab on trigger rather than grip. This breaks systems that rely on InputGrab and InputUse being different inputs on VR controllers.\n\nExample world: https://vrchat.com/home/world/wrld_03415963-883e-4510-9051-d142aeac65a5\n\nThis world uses a fully custom-made pickup system, and breaks with Vive wands.",
